(7488207, 1192226, 22288, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, it is something that is ugly but the capture and lighting make it look and feel nice. 8</td>', 'Very nice shot, it is something that is ugly but the capture and lighting make it look and feel nice. 8', '2016-12-21 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7488208, 1192185, 22288, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I love the feel of this photo, the color tones really make the photo. 8</td>', 'Nice capture, I love the feel of this photo, the color tones really make the photo. 8', '2016-12-21 16:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7488211, 1192101, 22288, '<td valign="top">This captures the theme nicely, especially as BW. I think if you had left it color it would not have been as dramatic. The person with the umbrella also drew me into the photo making something that would have been drab a bit more alluring. 7</td>', 'This captures the theme nicely, especially as BW. I think if you had left it color it would not have been as dramatic. The person with the umbrella also drew me into the photo making something that would have been drab a bit more alluring. 7', '2016-12-21 16:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7488214, 1191809, 22288, '<td valign="top">Nice macro capture. Definitely makes something that is uninteresting have a lot of flare. 8</td>', 'Nice macro capture. Definitely makes something that is uninteresting have a lot of flare. 8', '2016-12-21 16:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7488298, 1192126, 136989, '<td valign="top">Awh. They''re not ugly at all.</td>', 'Awh. They''re not ugly at all.', '2016-12-21 21:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7488326, 1192001, 15163, '<td valign="top">would be a cool "tree" submission too.</td>', 'would be a cool "tree" submission too.', '2016-12-22 07:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7488707, 1192218, 150202, '<td valign="top">A good shot, but the horizon of the water in the back isn''t level which always bugs me. Also needs more (or less) color. Color in the trees, a nice sunset in the background, or even making it black and white I think would have drawn me in more. I do like the composition and the angle the shot was taken. Good subject too.</td>', 'A good shot, but the horizon of the water in the back isn''t level which always bugs me. Also needs more (or less) color. Color in the trees, a nice sunset in the background, or even making it black and white I think would have drawn me in more. I do like the composition and the angle the shot was taken. Good subject too.', '2016-12-25 22:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7488709, 1192225, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the tyre, but the greenery that is both in and out of focus doesn''t do it for me. If the greenery had been all soft background or all sharp I would have liked it more personally. I do find the tyre really interesting and well done.  The patterns really draw the eye.</td>', 'I like the tyre, but the greenery that is both in and out of focus doesn''t do it for me. If the greenery had been all soft background or all sharp I would have liked it more personally. I do find the tyre really interesting and well done.  The patterns really draw the eye.', '2016-12-25 22:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
