(7488983, 1191898, 86447, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge topic!<br/> <br/>I wish the focus were sharper on his ugly face, though.  I do love the composition.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge topic! I wish the focus were sharper on his ugly face, though.  I do love the composition.', '2016-12-27 20:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
