(7489196, 1192235, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wanted to say something about how perfect this was for the challenge topic... during voting...<br/> <br/>But... I had been rendered speechless.<br/> <br/>A new feeling for me.<br/> <br/>This is perfect for the challenge topic.  I love the processing.<br/> <br/>Congrats!<br/></td>', 'I wanted to say something about how perfect this was for the challenge topic... during voting... But... I had been rendered speechless. A new feeling for me. This is perfect for the challenge topic.  I love the processing. Congrats!', '2016-12-28 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
